2186065009 #edb/ref 1061 1374 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065009 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "51842b79-1471-58e3-8240-0e6f8c062fda" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065009 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186065408 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065010 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186065016 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065010 #edb/ref 1061 1377 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065010 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "6e6c41bb-fda0-558d-bff8-d7d5bc882df6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065010 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186064172 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065016 #edb/ref 1061 1379 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065016 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "c64b94e8-f57d-5360-9a8d-ce365fb8c43d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065016 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186064177 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065017 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186065018 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065017 #edb/ref 1061 1381 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065017 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "49d02f63-57e0-5168-80dd-fdc3893de9af" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065017 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186065409 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065018 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186065019 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065018 #edb/ref 1061 1382 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065018 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "e743bf3f-f489-55bd-a78e-d650597e4e7c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065018 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186064178 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065019 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186065020 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065019 #edb/ref 1061 1385 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065019 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "cfb5a14e-cc92-584d-a9f2-ee04cb06b7ab" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065019 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186064179 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065020 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186065021 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065020 #edb/ref 1061 1387 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065020 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "1eb256c9-e635-52b0-9693-979de7534909" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065020 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186064180 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065021 #edb/ref 1061 1389 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065021 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "ffd7ef8c-69c3-5ccb-ac1c-da42a0605f1c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065021 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186064181 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065407 #edb/ref 1064 "Remember that the exponential function $e^x$ has the special property that the derivative of the exponential function is the exponential function itself. In other words, taking the derivative doesn't change anything, and we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm d x} \\left(e^ x\\right)  = e^ x.\n$$\n\nSince integration is the opposite of differentiation, and differentiating the exponential function leaves it unchanged, integrating the exponential function also leaves it unchanged. So, the integral of the exponential function is\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\int e^x \\, \\textrm d x = e^x +C.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065407 #edb/ref 1065 711 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065407 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "d2a6d036-0881-5a58-8935-905cd004a7e1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065407 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065408 #edb/ref 1064 "Remember that if $a$ is a positive real number, then the derivative of $a^x$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm d x}\\left( a^ x\\right)\t=\ta^ x \\ln a.\n$$\n\nSo, by \"reversing\" this process, we obtain the following formula for the integral of a general exponential function:\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\int  a^x \\, \\textrm d x  = \\dfrac{a^ x }{\\ln a} +C.\n$$\n\nFor instance, suppose that we wish to calculate the integral \n\n$$\n\\int 2^x  \\, \\textrm d x\n$$\n\nTo compute the integral of a general exponential function, we just need to divide by the natural logarithm of the base of the exponential function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int 2^x  \\, \\textrm d x   &= \\dfrac{2^x}{\\ln 2} + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065408 #edb/ref 1065 714 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065408 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "254d6a12-01a6-5a3b-b0fd-fbefc017a149" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065408 #edb/ref 1067 "Integrating an Exponential Function With a General Base" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065409 #edb/ref 1064 "We know that the derivative of sine is cosine:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d }{\\textrm d x}(\\sin{x}) = \\cos{x}\n$$\n\nSince integration is the reverse of differentiation, we see that the integral of cosine is sine:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{x}\\,\\textrm d x = \\sin{x} + C\n$$\n\nWe can discover two other integrals by considering the derivatives of cosine and tangent:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\text{ }\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C \\\\ \\int {sec}^{2}⁡x\\text{ }\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimilarly, by considering the derivatives of secant, cosecant, and cotangent, we arrive at\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\text{ }\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+C \\\\ \\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\text{ }\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x+C \\\\ \\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\text{ }\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWith these six formulas, we can integrate many different trigonometric functions." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065409 #edb/ref 1065 718 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065409 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "bfa0c70d-6cf7-5c69-8995-d9f6c980a4ba" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065409 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090532 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186090533 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090532 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186090534 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090532 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186090535 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090532 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186090536 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090532 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186090537 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090532 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090532 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090532 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186090534 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090532 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "7907bce1-6e91-548c-bf8c-f50341390d5a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090533 #edb/ref 1080 "77" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090533 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090533 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a3826d54-f39e-5e45-982c-0196c96b30c9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090534 #edb/ref 1080 "74" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090534 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186090534 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "bf822091-623a-5b75-a700-06562c3fa7b0" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
